{"id":"10116","label":"Dossier 2 - Boite à outils","hierarchy":"Types et genres de textes > Le texte narratif > Dossier 2 - Boite à outils","types":["Cases à cocher","Liens","Mots à compléter","Réponses écrites"],"exerciseCount":10,"exercises":[{"id":"107882","name":"M3_narr_D2_BAO_01","title":"<p><b>Associe le contexte donné au bon type de rupture chronologique.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_090a9b75-dd3b-494c-bd31-6cb70ca3ac95","type":"label","metrics":{"x":400,"y":130,"width":143,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":116},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">retour en arrière</p>"},{"id":"exelem_ad520b38-ca6e-437c-bd4a-a304cf938755","type":"label","metrics":{"x":190,"y":130,"width":101,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":114},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">anticipation</p>"},{"id":"exelem_d146f7be-8bfa-4cab-9859-5dfba336a580","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":130,"y":120,"width":"40","height":"40","zindex":111},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"A"},{"id":"exelem_86ac9c01-4236-4a85-a0d5-304d78c929b8","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":340,"y":120,"width":"40","height":"40","zindex":110},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"A"},{"id":"exelem_eb144a11-78d5-4c5c-e345-d6701258eaa3","type":"label","metrics":{"x":50,"y":180,"width":550,"fixed_width":"550","height":168,"zindex":106},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p><font size=\"18\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Me voici encore au-dessus de l’évier. Je savonne, je frotte, je rince, j’égoutte. Alors que je poursuis mes gestes machinaux, mon regard se perd dans le paysage devant moi. Je repense à l’été dernier, quand je me tenais au même endroit, alors qu’il faisait toujours soleil, dehors comme dans mon cœur. Je riais et dansais encore avec Fabi, lui soufflant des bulles de savon au passage. Si j’avais su ce qui nous attendait, j’aurais peut-être été moins insouciant…</font></p>"}]},"types":["Cases à cocher"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"10.4.1","displayLabel":"10.4.1 — Dossier 2 - Boite à outils"},{"id":"107885","name":"M3_narr_D2_BAO_02","title":"<p><b>Associe le contexte donné au bon type de rupture chronologique.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_090a9b75-dd3b-494c-bd31-6cb70ca3ac95","type":"label","metrics":{"x":400,"y":130,"width":143,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":116},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">retour en arrière</p>"},{"id":"exelem_ad520b38-ca6e-437c-bd4a-a304cf938755","type":"label","metrics":{"x":190,"y":130,"width":101,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":114},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">anticipation</p>"},{"id":"exelem_d146f7be-8bfa-4cab-9859-5dfba336a580","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":130,"y":120,"width":"40","height":"40","zindex":111},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"A"},{"id":"exelem_86ac9c01-4236-4a85-a0d5-304d78c929b8","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":340,"y":120,"width":"40","height":"40","zindex":110},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"A"},{"id":"exelem_eb144a11-78d5-4c5c-e345-d6701258eaa3","type":"label","metrics":{"x":50,"y":180,"width":550,"fixed_width":"550","height":192,"zindex":106},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p><font size=\"18\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Prenant place à sa table habituelle au café, Axelle repense à ce qu’aurait été sa vie si elle avait tourné à gauche tout juste avant le moment fatidique. Elle aurait évité cette rencontre inattendue avec Natalia, aurait poursuivi son traintrain quotidien, serait arrivée au boulot comme prévu. À ses vacances estivales, elle serait allée, comme à l’habitude, en Gaspésie pour voir sa tante. Les fêtes se seraient déroulées sans joie, mais sans flafla. Le bon vieux temps, quoi.</font></p>"}]},"types":["Cases à cocher"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"10.4.2","displayLabel":"10.4.2 — Dossier 2 - Boite à outils"},{"id":"107887","name":"M3_narr_D2_BAO_03","title":"<p><b>Associe le contexte donné au bon type de rupture chronologique.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_090a9b75-dd3b-494c-bd31-6cb70ca3ac95","type":"label","metrics":{"x":400,"y":130,"width":143,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":116},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">retour en arrière</p>"},{"id":"exelem_ad520b38-ca6e-437c-bd4a-a304cf938755","type":"label","metrics":{"x":190,"y":130,"width":101,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":114},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">anticipation</p>"},{"id":"exelem_d146f7be-8bfa-4cab-9859-5dfba336a580","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":130,"y":120,"width":"40","height":"40","zindex":111},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"A"},{"id":"exelem_86ac9c01-4236-4a85-a0d5-304d78c929b8","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":340,"y":120,"width":"40","height":"40","zindex":110},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"A"},{"id":"exelem_eb144a11-78d5-4c5c-e345-d6701258eaa3","type":"label","metrics":{"x":50,"y":180,"width":550,"fixed_width":"550","height":190,"zindex":106},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>Il marchait lentement dans son ancien quartier. Plus il approchait, plus il sentait la vague de souvenirs monter en lui. Des images de l’an dernier se succédaient&nbsp;: des cris, des coups, des gyrophares, un réveil brutal. Une médecin qui lui annonce la nouvelle. Une colère sans fin s’était emparée de son âme, son cœur avait été pris d’assaut de flammes intarissables. Malgré tous ses efforts, ce feu brulait encore.</p>"}]},"types":["Cases à cocher"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"10.4.3","displayLabel":"10.4.3 — Dossier 2 - Boite à outils"},{"id":"107926","name":"M3_narr_D2_BAO_04","title":"<font color=\"#FFFFFF\"><b>Relie les indices de temps et les temps verbaux au bon élément : anticipation ou retour en arrière.</b></font>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_263bbd39-7687-451d-a33b-13ae305c3bc2","type":"linkable","metrics":{"x":20,"y":320,"width":"160","height":"60","zindex":111},"linkable_type":"source","linkable_aspect":"button","linkable_content":"text","text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"text":"cond. présent ou passé","image":{"media_id":"","src":"","mime_type":"","base64":"","width":0,"height":0,"proportional":true,"allow_zoom":false,"alt":"","title":"","metrics":{"x":"8","y":"8","width":"","height":"","zindex":1}},"linkable_anchor":"right","choices":[{"id":"exelem_a3d83016-438c-47cb-e162-a7cbd694b341","text":"Retour en arrière"},{"id":"exelem_ddf300f3-12bd-434e-ecc6-6cb7bf7138f7","text":"Anticipation"}]},{"id":"exelem_7d6653e6-06ff-41bb-ec12-18fd8dd6c729","type":"linkable","metrics":{"x":20,"y":250,"width":"160","height":"60","zindex":109},"linkable_type":"source","linkable_aspect":"button","linkable_content":"text","text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"