;<b>ferais</b>.</p>"}]},"types":["Cases à cocher"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"10.4.10","displayLabel":"10.4.10 — Dossier 2 - Boite à outils"}],"themeNumber":"10","themeLabel":"Le texte narratif","number":"10.4","displayLabel":"10.4 — Dossier 2 - Boite à outils"}
